Files in this folder:
  model.json, group1-shard1of1.bin
    Unmodified copies of model/model.json and model/group1-shard1of1.bin from the
    npm package @spotify/basic-pitch 1.0.1 (https://github.com/spotify/basic-pitch-ts).
  LICENSE
    The Apache License 2.0 text shipped with that package.

Chords Listener also contains a modified port of the package's note post-processing
(src/toMidi.ts: outputToNotesPoly) in frontend/src/lib/transcription/basicPitch/postprocess.ts:
same algorithm, rewritten for typed arrays with a heap-driven "melodia trick" so that whole
songs decode in linear-logarithmic time; equivalence with the original is checked by
frontend/src/lib/transcription/basicPitch/postprocess.test.ts.

Reference: R. M. Bittner, J. J. Bosch, D. Rubinstein, G. Meseguer-Brocal, S. Ewert,
"A Lightweight Instrument-Agnostic Model for Polyphonic Note Transcription and
Multipitch Estimation", ICASSP 2022.
